{UTF-8}
Normal Buy Price=
	15000
	~	Dollars / Car
	~		|

Buy Price= GAME (
	Normal Buy Price)
	~	Dollars/Car
	~		|

Car Bought from Lot=
	Cars Sold
	~	Cars / Year
	~		|

Cars Sold=
	Normal Cars Sold*(Average Car Quality/Normal Quality)*(Normal Sell Price/Sell Price)
	~	Cars / Year
	~		|

Quality Per Car Sold=
	Normal Quality*(Buy Price/Normal Buy Price)
	~	Quality / Car
	~		|

Sell Price= GAME (
	Normal Sell Price)
	~	Dollars/Car
	~		|

Normal Sell Price=
	Normal Buy Price*1.2
	~	Dollars/Car
	~		|

Normal Cars Sold=
	0.8*50
	~	Cars / Year
	~		|

Average Car Quality=
	Total Car Quality/Used Cars in Lot
	~	Quality/Car
	~		|

Cars Sold to Lot=
	0.8*50
	~	Cars / Year
	~		|

Decrease in Car Quality=
	Average Car Quality*Car Bought from Lot
	~	Quality/Year
	~		|

Increase in Car Quality=
	Cars Sold to Lot*Quality Per Car Sold
	~	Quality / Year
	~		|

Initial Cars in Lot=
	2000
	~	Cars
	~		|

Normal Quality=
	1
	~	Quality / Car
	~		|

Total Car Quality= INTEG (
	Increase in Car Quality-Decrease in Car Quality,
		Normal Quality*Initial Cars in Lot)
	~	Quality
	~		|

Used Cars in Lot= INTEG (
	Cars Sold to Lot-Car Bought from Lot,
		Initial Cars in Lot)
	~	Cars
	~		|

********************************************************
	.Control
********************************************************~
		Simulation Control Parameters
	|

FINAL TIME  = 365
	~	Year
	~	The final time for the simulation.
	|

INITIAL TIME  = 0
	~	Year
	~	The initial time for the simulation.
	|

SAVEPER  = 
        TIME STEP 
	~	Year [0,?]
	~	The frequency with which output is stored.
	|

TIME STEP  = 1
	~	Year [0,?]
	~	The time step for the simulation.
	|

